<title>FINLAND: FINNISH AUG TRADE DATA DUE TODAY AT NOON - NCB.</title>
<headline>FINNISH AUG TRADE DATA DUE TODAY AT NOON - NCB.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish August foreign trade data will be published today on Friday at 1200/1000 GMT, the National Customs Board (NCB) said in a statement on Friday.  </p>
<p>In July, Finland's trade surplus was 3.17 billion markka, according to NCB data.</p>
<p>The Bank of Finland has estimated the August trade balance at 3.5 billion markka with exports at 13.8 billion and imports at 10.3 billion markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50</p>
</text>
